// 0x0062CCE0, 551B).  This shape is 549B with 108 non-reloc diffs, first at
// +0x083, and EVERY [esp+K] displacement in it matches retail's exactly, so
// the frame layout is solved: sub esp,0x3c, ebp as the zero register, the
