//   +0x17d..0x184   8   cluster B  the mismatch diff's redundant `cmp`
//   +0x1bc..0x1c9  14   R2b  the inner-bound form (below)
//   +0x1cb..0x21c  63   the pure 2-byte cascade after R2, plus one ecx/edx
