// Fixing R2 alone would make the size exact and collapse the 63-byte cascade;
// cluster B is length-neutral and only matters after R2.
//
// R1 SOLVED.  The compare's length tail must be a named local tested in its
// own statement:
//     const int tail = len1 - len2;
//     if (tail != 0) return tail;
//     return 0;
